---
---

<section class="section section-tint" id="user-cases">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head">
      <h2>Real workflows. <strong>Real results.</strong></h2>
      <p>See how global teams use Whale to automate the work that used to take hours.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="case-grid">
      <article class="case-card case-card-large" id="nio-case">
        <div class="case-visual">
          <img src="https://whale-web.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/2025-08-22/154269282.jpeg" alt="NIO showroom" loading="eager" decoding="async">
          <span class="case-logo"><img src="/nio-logo.svg" alt="NIO" loading="eager" decoding="async"></span>
          <div class="nio-scan" aria-hidden="true">
            <div class="scan-glow"></div>
            <div class="scan-beam"></div>
            <div class="scan-mark" style="top: 38%; left: 18%;"></div>
            <div class="scan-mark" style="top: 52%; left: 58%;"></div>
            <div class="scan-mark" style="top: 44%; left: 74%;"></div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="case-industry">Automotive</span>
          <h3>NIO × Whale | Scaling a lifestyle brand with consistent content</h3>
          <p>NIO used Whale's data and content systems to raise the quality and consistency of marketing materials across showrooms and digital channels.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case-card">
        <div class="case-visual">
          <img src="https://whale-web.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/2025-08-22/154453444.jpeg" alt="Watsons store" loading="eager" decoding="async">
          <span class="case-logo"><img src="https://whale-web.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/2025-08-22/162423348.png" alt="Watsons" loading="eager" decoding="async"></span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="case-industry">Retail</span>
          <h3>Watsons × Whale | Keeping shoppers in store longer</h3>
          <p>Watsons used Whale SpaceSight to measure dwell time and test how promotions are displayed in-store, leading to longer visits and clearer in-store communication.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      <article class="case-card">
        <div class="case-visual">
          <img src="https://www.whale.sg/images/2025/zwj/bg2.jpg" alt="Unilever digital store" loading="eager" decoding="async">
          <span class="case-logo">Unilever</span>
        </div>
        <div class="case-body">
          <span class="case-industry">Retail</span>
          <h3>Unilever × Whale</h3>
          <p>Built the Future-Sense Digital Store, a retail innovation powered by Whale intelligence.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
